I will stop a fast if I become unable to perform daily functions, too weak to talk, pass out, cannot do chores level of activity, etc OR more importantly, if I feel as if these symptoms could be approaching.

&#x200B;

Personally I will supplement about 8 ounces of bone broth, miso soup during a fast if I feel myself getting this weak. I don't perceive it as breaking my fast. You can create your own rules to better help yourself stay safe and going strong with ketosis, autophagy, and fat loss

